{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50727","headline":"送法镜上人归上元 · 张祜","name":"送法镜上人归上元","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国僧游二十年，却因无任访生缘。\n风回建业秋归寺，月满秦淮夜到舡。\n故老尽成双鬓雪，旧房深鏁一林烟。\n莫言了悟爲真理，不叹兴亡在眼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}